    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(I) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, Ministerof Higher Education and of Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by this Order, amendthe Schedule to the Order made under section 21 of the aforesaid Act, establishing the South Eastern University of Sri Lanka,published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 916/7 of March 27, 1996 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary,No. 2023/31 of June 14, 2017) by the addition immediately after the entry \"(f). Department of English Language Teaching\"appearing in Column II under the heading \"Department of Study\" which corresponds to the entry \"Faculty of Arts andCulture\" appearing in Column I under the heading \"Faculty\" of the Schedule II to such Order, of the following new item:-",
